WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.620
Beneficiary cases: beneficiary cases: the public part donors see and the private part only the team sees.

2
00:00:10.173 --> 00:00:16.510
Click "New case"; in "The public part", write the title, "Amount needed" and story.

3
00:00:17.064 --> 00:00:22.860
Put the real name, contact and notes only in "The private part (team only)".

4
00:00:23.406 --> 00:00:27.110
Link the case to a campaign and follow its progress.

5
00:00:27.659 --> 00:00:33.220
Never put anything that identifies a beneficiary in the public part or photos.
